WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.637
Day three.

00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:02.728
You did your part.

00:00:03.332 --> 00:00:05.155
You got to the bus stop on time.

00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:06.467
Ten minutes pass.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:07.837
Then fifteen.

00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:09.427
Your transit app now says the bus

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.494
is delayed another twenty-five minutes.

00:00:11.494 --> 00:00:13.444
Your shift starts in thirty-five.

00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:15.847
You didn't create the problem—but you still

00:00:15.847 --> 00:00:18.285
have to decide how to respond to it.

00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:19.412
What do you do?
